---
---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="container grid">
    <div class="copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">RESTAURANT × PRIMARY INDUSTRY</p>
      <h1>飲食店が利益を出す<br />仕組みを、<span class="accent">ぶっちゃける。</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">
        BUTCHAKEは千代田区の飲食店向けの求人サービスを提供する企業です。また農業・漁業などの一次産業と飲食店も繋ぎます。
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-primary">事業概要を見る</a>
        <a href="#club" class="btn btn-ghost">CLUB BUTCHAKE</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="figure">
      <div class="frame"></div>
      <img src="/images/hero.webp" alt="BUTCHAKE" width="320" height="320" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 96px 32px 88px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0;
    max-width: var(--max-width);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 52px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  h1 .accent {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .lead {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-size: 16px;
    max-width: 30em;
    color: var(--ink-78);
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 40px;
  }

  .btn {
    padding: 15px 30px;
    font-size: 13px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--primary);
    color: var(--bg-base);
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--bg-base);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    border: 1px solid var(--primary-border-35);
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .btn-ghost:hover {
    border-color: var(--primary);
    background: var(--primary-hover-bg);
  }

  .figure {
    position: relative;
  }

  .frame {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 24px -24px -24px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--primary-border-25);
  }

  .figure img {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    height: 440px;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: saturate(0.92);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero {
      padding: 64px 20px 56px;
    }

    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 34px;
    }

    .frame {
      inset: 16px -16px -16px 16px;
    }

    .figure img {
      height: 300px;
    }
  }
</style>
